                                "example_id": "424c7669-6cf3-4a72-94b3-b1ddaa29c613",
                                "sense_id": "181a7569-89bc-3c24-97d6-cccc4914acf8",
                                "text": "[…] the artists' association will be forced to advance or delay its vernissage and opening day."
